# REQUIRES: verilator
# --pp-idle-skip (foldsim-fold-static pp-idle-skip, with --pp-dirty-writeback): a streamed state-in-ram-pp instance
# whose rows did not change in its pass of the frame before, and whose producers' rows did not either (its inputs
# are early links, so they are the frame before's), skips its prefetch, its pass and its writes. Its link entries
# keep their last write, which is the value the skipped write would write. Driver/Inputs/idle: eight nodes in a chain
# behind a pulse source go idle between pulses. Node 0 reads the source (no clean bits), so 7 of 8 decide.
# Exact against the target at latencies 1-90, with stalls, full controllers and bubbles: on its own controllers,
# with P = 4 on page engines under nest/modulo, with the node links as HBM link streams, and with the S30 recipe's
# HBM mailboxes. FOLDSIM_SKIP_TRACE prints a line a skip: skips happen. Two mutants mismatch:
# FOLDSIM_IDLE_SKIP_MUTANT=1 ignores the producers' clean bits, =2 reads the clean bits of the wrong frame.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t && cd %S/../Driver/Inputs/idle
# RUN: env FOLDSIM_PP_ROWS=balanced foldsim --srcs top.f --top Top --out %t/a --static --state-in-ram Node::2 --state-in-ram-pp --state-scratch-bits 0 --pp-dirty-writeback --pp-idle-skip Node Src Sink > %t/a.log 2>&1
# RUN: FileCheck %s --check-prefix=LOG < %t/a.log
# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/a -DFOLDSIM_SKIP_TRACE -Mdir %t/a/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv nodes.sv top.sv %t/a/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/a/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/a/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+1 +lo=1 > %t/a/r1.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s < %t/a/r1.log
# RUN: grep -c "idle-skip: Node" %t/a/r1.log | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SKIPS
# RUN: %t/a/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=60 +stall=20 +full=20 > %t/a/r2.log
# RUN: FileCheck %s < %t/a/r2.log
# RUN: grep -c "idle-skip: Node" %t/a/r2.log | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=SKIPS
# RUN: %t/a/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+5 +lo=5 +hi=90 +stall=30 +full=30 | FileCheck %s
