# RUN: %verilator --binary --timing -Wno-fatal -Wno-lint --top-module tb -I%t/x2 -Mdir %t/x2/obj %S/Inputs/tb_pages.sv nodes.sv top.sv %t/x2/foldsim_sim.sv > %t/x2/build.log 2>&1
# RUN: %t/x2/obj/Vtb +verilator+rand+reset+0 +verilator+seed+3 +lo=1 +hi=60 +stall=20 +full=20 | FileCheck %s --check-prefix=BAD

# LOG: pp-idle-skip: 1 classes keep clean bits, 1 may skip
# LOG: pp-idle-skip: Node: 7 of 8 instances decide ({{[0-9]+}} source reads; instances not: 0 an environment input, 0 a late input, 1 an untracked source, 0 in time)
# LOG: pp-idle-skip: 1 classes' clean bits in {{[0-9]+}} replicas, 7 of 8 instances decide
# MBOX: link streams: {{[1-9][0-9]*}} streams
# NODW: pp-idle-skip: off (it needs pp-dirty-writeback)
# NODW-NOT: instances decide
# SKIPS: {{^[1-9][0-9][0-9]+$}}
# QUIET-NOT: idle-skip
# QUIET: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# BAD: {{^}}MISMATCH
# CHECK: {{^}}MATCH 196 cycles
# CHECK-NOT: PROTOCOL
